#01  Polynomials: game rules
===================================================================================================

  TEASER: polynomial, degree, order, coefficient, leading coefficient, term, leading term, canonical form, factored form, monic, discriminant, discriminate, root, monomial, binomial, trinomial, constant, affine, linear, quadratic, biquadratic, cubic, quartic, quintic, sextic, septic, octic, nonic, decic, undecic, duodecic, tredecic, ... yes, indeed: I did ruin the whole chapter's layout right from the very first line only for the sake of a stupid joke —— you're welcome.
  Welcome to the section of legion words.

  "Naturopathy" is an illiterate word.
  It starts Latin and turns Greek about half-way.
  /*
    "Naturopassion", ok;
    "physicopathy", ok;
